  "problem": "Let $R=[15,20]\\times [3,5]$ be a region in the $xy$-plane, and let $f(x,y)=x-3y.$\nFurther, let $P$ be a partition of $R,$ where\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{P}_{1}={{x}_{0},{x}_{1},\u2026,{x}_{m}},\\,{P}_{2}={{y}_{0},{y}_{1},\u2026,{y}_{n}},\\,P={P}_{1}\\times {P}_{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nGiven that the upper Riemann sum of $f$ with respect to $P$ is given by\n\n$$\nU(f,P)={\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}\\boxed{}\\,\u0394{x}_{i}\u0394{y}_{j}\n$$\n\nwhere $\u0394{x}_{i}={x}_{i}-{x}_{i-1}$ and $\u0394{y}_{j}={y}_{j}-{y}_{j-1},$\nwhat is the missing expression in the double summation above?",
